# {{NAME}}

MCP server.

## Setup

```bash
npm install
npm run build
```

## Install into Claude Code

```bash
staff install {{NAME}}
```

Or manually add to your Claude Code settings:

```json
{
  "mcpServers": {
    "{{NAME}}": {
      "command": "node",
      "args": ["/path/to/{{NAME}}/dist/index.js"]
    }
  }
}
```

## Development

```bash
npm run dev    # Watch mode
npm run build  # Production build
```

